{"id":"3368c1852f2a1aa0","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-natural-number.md","title":"Natural Numbers","display":"df-natural-number — Natural Numbers","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-natural-number","aliases":["68-df-natural-number"],"display":"df-natural-number — Natural Numbers","depends_on":[],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§2 p.2 / PDF 11","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"not-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-natural-number"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-natural-number</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-natural-number — Natural Numbers"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§2 p.2 / PDF 11"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>在 ZFC 的元理论中采用最小无限序数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 及其通常算术。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> 是本目录的自然数域记号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N:=\\omega.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N:=\\omega.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §2，印刷 p.2 / PDF p.11，number 指非负整数，因而包括 0。此处只固定基础域，不再把整个第 58 本的上游图误作本书定义所需依赖。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N:=\\omega.","display":true}],"bytes":818,"backlinks":[{"id":"5e61d0905238a638","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e1d430cdc0e4cc29","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，自然数见 [[68-df-natural-number]]。"},{"id":"ce9dbd1a2da08015","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5845ef9114a1d1d9","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c524671590651be2","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"以 [[68-df-natural-number]] 的 $\\mathbb N=\\omega$ 为自然数域。$k,\\ell,y\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\mathbb N^0=\\{()\\}$；一元输入元组与其唯一分量识别。$\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k$，$\\vec z\\in\\mathbb N^\\ell$；偏值条款中的 $f\\in\\mathcal F_k$、$g\\in\\mathcal F_\\ell$。$a,b$ 为任意有限序列，$\\operatorname{lh}$ 在 Assertion 中定义；$a\\,^{\\frown}b$ 只表示两个有限序列的连接，追加元素 $u$ 写作 $a\\,^{\\frown}\\langle u\\rangle$。$\\operatorname{Gr}_k$ 把偏函数图转换成 $(k+1)$ 元数关系。"},{"id":"007638c1acc7d921","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e63c3a4e8bd71ca4","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7fc8baae87b873a3","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"27dbc26143606cc1","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e88d3edb906e9454","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2c2f80ef5e90c5ab","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-natural-number]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-53","loc